<title>USA: Plains Resources Inc Q3 net shr rises.</title>
<headline>Plains Resources Inc Q3 net shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.28		    $0.03</p>
<p> Oper shr		    0.20		     0.03</p>
<p> Net			  5,001			483</p>
<p> Revs		     169,245		  103,607</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,821		   16,174</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.69		    $0.10</p>
<p> Oper shr		    0.98		     0.10</p>
<p> Net			 12,212		    1,716</p>
<p> Revs		     448,688		  292,510</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,578		   15,951</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 operating earnings per share exclude a gain of $0.08 per share related to the treatment of deferred taxes.</p>
<p>Net earnings in the first nine months of 1996 include a one-time extraordinary loss of $8.5 million related to the early redemption of debt, a $4 million charge related to the settlement of a lawsuit and an $11 million tax benefit related to the reversal of a portion of the valuation reserve against the company's deferred tax asset.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
